 Productivity\":\"Reduce graymail and unwanted messages so inboxes stay focused.\",\"Google Workspace Integration\":\"Direct API access to Google Workspace with zero infrastructure.\",\"Identity Threat Protection\":\"Correlate signals to contain threats before and after authentication.\",\"Inbound Email Security\":\"Stop BEC, phishing, and credential theft before delivery.\",\"Infiltration Prevention\":\"Detect synthetic personas and infiltration campaigns before access is provisioned.\",\"Messaging Security\":\"Detect and remediate malicious content in messaging apps.\",\"Microsoft 365 Integration\":\"Native API connection to Microsoft 365 — no MX changes, deploy in minutes.\",\"Misdirected Email\":\"Prevent accidental data leakage from misaddressed email.\",\"Okta Integration\":\"Stream identity events from Okta to detect compromised accounts in real time.\",\"SaaS Account Takeover Protection\":\"Detect compromise across your full SaaS surface — not just email.\",\"SaaS Security Posture Management\":\"Surface misconfigurations and privilege drift across SaaS apps.\",\"Posture Management\":\"Catch risky misconfigurations across your email platform.\",\"Technology Integrations\":\"100+ native API integrations across your cloud security stack.\",\"VendorBase\":\"A federated database of vendor compromise indicators.\",\"What We Protect\":\"Every identity, channel, and attack surface covered by Abnormal AI.\"}},\"sections\":{\"faqHeadline\":\"FAQ\"},\"demoTheater\":{\"eyebrow\":\"Demo Theater\",\"heading\":\"Watch Abnormal Find Unapproved AI\",\"body\":\"See how Abnormal discovers shadow AI use, hands security a policy decision, and routes the employee to an approved alternative — narrated beat by beat, no sales call required.\",\"introCtaLabel\":\"Talk to Sales\",\"playLabel\":\"Play the Find Unapproved AI scenario\",\"embedTitle\":\"Demo Theater: Find Unapproved AI\",\"posterAlt\":\"Abnormal's AI Governance dashboard showing unreviewed AI OAuth grants, open threats, 